{{Quote|Forged in the fires of both heaven and hell. Beware, for those who wield it risk being consumed by its curse.|Item}}
The '''Cursed Dual Katana''' is a {{Mythical}} [[sword]].

The Cursed Dual Katana features high damage output and long-range hitboxes, though its effectiveness depends on landing precise combos. Its moves are excellent, but are very easy to [[Instinct]] trick and do not offer true stuns, making it easy for the user to get punished. It has extremely long range, mostly used for its impeccable ability to defeat [[Dragon]] users with '''[X]''' '''Slayer of Goliath'''.

The Cursed Dual Katana is a great sword for grinding, often regarded as one of the best in the game due to its high damage [M1] attacks being very compatible with [[Buddha]], and having no dash.

